message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "SimSoM NGen"
abstract: "The Simulator of Social Media, the Next Generation, applies agent-based modeling techniques to model an online information ecosystem, in particular to simulate the diffusion of, and exposure to, content by social media users."
